  "details": "I can't pick up items, every time I click, it flings the items in a random direction, I've been playing on this computer for a few months now, and it started the day of the new PC hud update, never really getting fixed.\n\nI play on linux, via steam, and it worked fine until this update, I don't know what's causing it, but I can't get it to go away, either someone help or get it patched, please.\n\nOh, and adding on; if I use an item that I manage to hold, I can't hold down the use button, meaning if I am (for example) shooting an automatic gun in prison escape, I have to rapidly tap m1 to use it.\n\nAnother addition; I have been getting around this issue by using controller, as it's only on keyboard and mouse where it's bugging out like this.",
